"lately...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫(……요즘 ⟪k:12⟫안개가 잦네……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5184B641_BE1E_41EC_ACA3_AF447236AA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab87a7f88e82d1b4650e684810943789cdccc7736f82d75e7cb4145dd1ed1185
