#: scenario5:scenario5_A1BC6589_AD46_4643_96C3_5BCB407C5728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0034b852484debec493bf70b8580fdc776daebd9d1495eb5fe5b97c61969aad
#. default-sha256: 31a8ceb81652e2093bd0db42eed18e93bbe9ed13b2e7de8c9f4acc693dc39ceb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A1BC6589_AD46_4643_96C3_5BCB407C5728"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If there wasn’t so much fog, I would probably have been able to see little columns of orange "
"evening sunlight fighting their way through the trees,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫안개가 끼지 않았다면 ⟪k:1⟫내리쬐는 노을이 주위를 비추었으리라."

#: scenario5:scenario5_139A6283_5350_4BBB_9D26_9529B5C9F3DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20c1070b4e6ee9832933b56dba4f8d107cd7b719bfeac28adb1c5d959c89a630
#. default-sha256: befb55a219e06e0d351e629a1e3d4705be757a18af9dabe1fd9bd147fafcda49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_139A6283_5350_4BBB_9D26_9529B5C9F3DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but the milky white mist seemed to swallow up all the light,⟪k:1⟫leaving nothing for the "
"surrounding area."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 유백색 안개가 모든 걸 가려서 ⟪k:1⟫세계가 빛을 잃은 것만 같았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_ABF9FD7C_1F81_4AD6_A52E_98FBE2F3099A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: befc398e51616b1dd767c658eb8e0c532550669fe0243d44eac86df515c6d4f2
