msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(안 와도 ⟪k:1⟫괜찮긴 해)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1C663933_CC3C_4A8C_8FA8_22FCC787163A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8ca0dc542b74cb28542fcb1ef7a188bfc0d3b37d6641087dd5e342cfba35405
#. default-sha256: b624db454444c6a658cb782b144f10955ad22368775fa554dfa1cd8e5e063bfd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1C663933_CC3C_4A8C_8FA8_22FCC787163A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was finally able to return to the capital with Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To see my family again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸과 함께 ⟪k:1⟫수도로 돌아가는 날. ⟪k:2⟫그때가 되면 가족을 다시 만날 수 있다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1DCBDA29_6825_4BF2_A6BD_F46E4A4F6E40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a736cbcf174698b33e8c0321b8f6763e16ed939a4aab7bb84a84273d16efa40b
#. default-sha256: bf54d4b5ac916824b65de9d1dc7ce6b2695e8752ef1bedf39538fe5ff6836689
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1DCBDA29_6825_4BF2_A6BD_F46E4A4F6E40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that was wonderful. It was like a dream come true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 매우 좋은 일이고,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫생각만 해도 가슴이 뛰지만――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D40B4C91_DFB6_436C_8534_233B6CA85B30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a5925f4f9b02ff85bdbbb0c0547498242763df4dcc41cfdde6304eca069ac59
