msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5DC6471F_7070_4638_9EEE_BF3AF17D1D93"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I reached my hands out to shut a window—⟪k:1⟫which is when I saw something wavering beyond "
"the heavy mist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫창문을 닫으려고 ⟪k:1⟫팔을 벌린 순간――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫자욱한 안개 너머에 ⟪k:4⟫일렁이는 무언가가 보였"
"다."

