msgstr "⟪k:0⟫완만하면서도 ⟪k:1⟫규칙적인 상하운동."

#: scenario5:scenario5_53E54130_E223_4221_ADC7_D0176A8A58B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 954a7d53eea23d93758f955c330acd438e177c583f75a912a93d7245365ca88f
