msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Could they be our escorts... ⟪k:1⟫back to the capital? ⟪k:2⟫Though...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(설마 ⟪k:1⟫마중이…… 온 걸까. ⟪k:2⟫근데 ⟪k:3⟫그런 것 치곤――)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1B8861E6_2BEE_47C6_8693_B813B7467DD7
